{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04407","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 三十三 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 三十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金鼎合神丹，世人将见欺。\n飞飞骑羊子，胡乃在峨眉。\n变化固幽类，芳菲能几时。\n疲痾苦沦世，忧痗日侵淄。\n眷然顾幽褐，白云空涕洟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}